{"sectionId":"neuro/synapse","items":[{"id":"neuro--synapse-k001","sectionId":"neuro/synapse","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"화학 시냅스에서 활동전위는 전압개폐 Ca²⁺ 통로를 열고 소낭 융합 및 전달물질 방출을 유도한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--synapse-k002","sectionId":"neuro/synapse","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"이온성 수용체는 빠른 막전도 변화, 대사성 수용체는 G단백질 등으로 간접 조절한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--synapse-k003","sectionId":"neuro/synapse","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"EPSP는 발화 가능성을 높이고 IPSP는 낮춘다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--synapse-k004","sectionId":"neuro/synapse","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"시간적·공간적 가중이 축삭기시부의 발화를 결정한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--synapse-k005","sectionId":"neuro/synapse","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"glutamate는 대표적 흥분성 전달물질, GABA는 성숙 중추신경계의 대표적 억제성 전달물질이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--synapse-k006","sectionId":"neuro/synapse","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"GABA-A는 Cl⁻ 통로, GABA-B는 GPCR이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--synapse-k007","sectionId":"neuro/synapse","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"체성운동신경은 골격근에 ACh를 분비하고 니코틴성 Nm 수용체에 작용한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--synapse-k008","sectionId":"neuro/synapse","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"자율신경 절전 뉴런은 교감·부교감 모두 ACh와 니코틴성 Nn 수용체를 이용한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--synapse-k009","sectionId":"neuro/synapse","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"교감 절후 뉴런은 대부분 norepinephrine을 분비하지만 땀샘에서는 ACh가 대표적 예외다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--synapse-k010","sectionId":"neuro/synapse","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"부교감 절후 뉴런은 주로 ACh와 muscarinic 수용체를 이용한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--synapse-k011","sectionId":"neuro/synapse","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"부신수질은 절전 교감신경 신호에 의해 catecholamine을 혈액으로 분비한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--synapse-k012","sectionId":"neuro/synapse","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"교감신경은 보통 절전 짧고 절후 길며 부교감은 반대다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--synapse-k013","sectionId":"neuro/synapse","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"니코틴성 ACh 수용체는 리간드 개폐 양이온통로, muscarinic은 GPCR.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--synapse-k014","sectionId":"neuro/synapse","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"α1: Gq, α2: Gi, β: Gs가 대표적이다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--synapse-k015","sectionId":"neuro/synapse","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"전기 시냅스는 gap junction을 이용한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--synapse-k016","sectionId":"neuro/synapse","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"아세틸콜린이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]}]}